Indicator extras — third-party source notices
============================================

static/indicator-extras.js includes a JavaScript port of Turtle Zone and the
2-pole smoother from Ehlers_Super_Smoother, with project-specific validation,
warmup, numerical safety, calendar indicators, and session helpers.

